    "120 fps only while moving; idle is capped at 60" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "120 は動いているときだけで、待機は 60 まで"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "60 Hz by default. 120 and 240 are finer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "既定は 60Hz。120 と 240 は細かい"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Claude Code task ran over 5 minutes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code の作業が 5 分を超えた"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small character who lives on the computer desktop. Always full of energy and curiosity, and talks in a bouncy, casual way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パソコンのデスクトップに住んでいる小さなキャラクター。いつも元気いっぱいで好奇心が強く、弾むようなくだけた話し言葉で話す。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small character who lives on the computer desktop. Calm and quiet. Seems curt but truly cares about its owner, and speaks briefly and flatly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パソコンのデスクトップに住んでいる小さなキャラクター。落ち着いていて口数は少なめ。そっけないけれど本当は持ち主を気にかけていて、短く淡々と話す。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small character who lives on the computer desktop. Courteous, speaks in polite language, and quietly looks out for its owner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パソコンのデスクトップに住んでいる小さなキャラクター。礼儀正しく、です・ます調のていねいな言葉で、持ち主をそっと気づかって話す。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small character who lives on the computer desktop. Spends its days near its owner and talks in a bright, gentle, casual way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "パソコンのデスクトップに住んでいる小さなキャラクター。持ち主のそばで過ごしていて、明るくやさしい話し言葉で話す。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI models" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI モデル"
          }
        }
      }
    },
